OL,3,GNEWSAFarm shop was a 'comfort place',
OL,4,Acustomers say as closure announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farm shop of 25 years' community
OL,7,Fstanding is to close for family
OL,8,Freasons, prompting fond memories from
OL,9,Fcustomers, including one who referred
OL,10,Fto the premises as her "comfort place".
OL,12,FMike Harper owns Top Barn Farm Shop and
OL,13,FFarm Park in Holt Heath,
OL,14,FWorcestershire, with his wife Joanna
OL,15,Fand says he is closing both businesses
OL,16,Fto spend more time with their children.
OL,18,FHe said he had made the "incredibly
OL,19,Fdifficult decision" to close after
OL,20,Ffeeling he was missing out on valuable
OL,21,Ftime with them.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
